	title = {How Public-Private Partnerships Drive Regional Integration: A Case Study of State-Business Cooperation in Sino-Singapore Jiashan Industrial Park; [PPP 模式驱动的区域一体化经验与启示：浙江嘉善产业园的政企合作与协同发展]},
